{"name":"Yearling","hex":"#ad896a","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"yearling","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An animal that is between one and two years old; one that is in its second year (but not yet two full years old).","A racehorse that is considered to be one year old until a subsequent January 1st."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/yearling"}],"entries":[{"title":"Yearling (horse)","blocks":[{"text":"A yearling is a young horse either male or female that is between one and two years old. Yearlings are comparable in development to a very early adolescent and are not fully mature physically. While they may be in the earliest stages of sexual maturity, they are considered too young to be breeding stock."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/SilverMorgan.jpg/330px-SilverMorgan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yearling_(horse)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/SilverMorgan.jpg/330px-SilverMorgan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/SilverMorgan.jpg/330px-SilverMorgan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A yearling","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASilverMorgan.jpg"}],"sounds":{"yearling":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-yearling.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-yearling.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-yearling.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-yearling.wav/L